OL,3,GNEWSAManslaughter charge after boy's
OL,4,A2024 crash death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with the
OL,7,Fmanslaughter of a teenage motorcyclist
OL,8,Fwho died a day after a crash in October
OL,9,F2024.
OL,11,FAidan Tottman, 16, was one of two boys
OL,12,Fwho were seriously injured after the
OL,13,Fincident outside Liquid Leisure in
OL,14,FHorton Road in Datchet, Berkshire, on
OL,15,F19 October 2024. He died in hospital
OL,16,Fthe next day.
OL,18,FNeil Carr, 57, of Bowden Road, was
OL,19,Fcharged with one count of manslaughter,
OL,20,Fcausing death by dangerous driving and
OL,21,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,22,Fdriving on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
